_Intro:"Requests travel from desk to desk in the order below (e.g. Secretary → Administrator → CEO). New requests land on the first active desk; the officers attached to a desk receive, acknowledge, respond, forward, return, approve or reject what is on it.",Pt_No_Officers:"No officers yet",Pt_Officers:"Officers",Pt_Order:"Order",Pt_Active_Requests:"Active requests",Pt_Complaint:"Complaint",Pt_Memo:"Memo",Pt_Letter:"Letter",Pt_Document:"Administrative document",Pt_Enquiry:"Enquiry",Pt_Other:"Other correspondence",Pt_Low:"Low",Pt_Normal:"Normal",Pt_High:"High",Pt_Urgent:"Urgent",Pt_Open:"Awaiting receipt",Pt_Received:"Received",Pt_Acknowledged:"Acknowledged",Pt_In_Progress:"In progress",Pt_Approved:"Approved",Pt_Rejected:"Rejected",Pt_Closed:"Closed",Pt_Active:"Active",Pt_Ev_Submitted:"Submitted",Pt_Ev_Note:"Internal note",Pt_Ev_Response:"Response",Pt_Ev_Reply:"Customer reply",Pt_Ev_Forwarded:"Forwarded",Pt_Ev_Reassigned:"Reassigned",Pt_Ev_Returned:"Returned to previous desk",Pt_Ev_Reopened:"Reopened",Pt_Ev_Attachment:"Documents attached",Pt_Ev_Updated:"Details edited",Pt_Act_Receive:"Receive",Pt_Act_Acknowledge:"Acknowledge",Pt_Act_Note:"Add note",Pt_Act_Respond:"Respond",Pt_Act_Attach:"Attach documents",Pt_Act_Forward:"Forward",Pt_Act_Reassign:"Reassign",Pt_Act_Return:"Return to previous desk",Pt_Act_Approve:"Approve",Pt_Act_Reject:"Reject",Pt_Act_Close:"Close",Pt_Act_Reopen:"Reopen",Pt_Perm_View:"View requests (own, desk, assigned)",Pt_Perm_Add:"Submit requests",Pt_Perm_Act:"Act on requests at my desks",Pt_Perm_Manage:"Manage desks & all requests",Customer_Performance:"Customer Performance",Total_Orders:"Total Orders",Average_Order_Value:"Average Order Value",Last_Purchase:"Last Purchase",First_Purchase:"First Purchase",Orders_Per_Month:"Orders / Month",Paid_Ratio:"Paid Ratio",Return_Rate:"Return Rate",Score_breakdown:"Score breakdown",Payment_reliability:"Payment reliability",Recency:"Recency",Rating_excellent:"Excellent",Rating_good:"Good",Rating_fair:"Fair",Rating_poor:"Poor",Rating_new:"New customer",No_purchases_yet:"No purchases yet",Rating_appears_after_first_sale:"A rating appears after the first completed sale.",days_ago:"days ago",Last_Seen:"Last Seen",Rating_capped:"Rating limited",Flag_low_payment:"Less than half of what they were billed has been paid.",Flag_dormant:"No purchase in over a year.",Flag_high_returns:"More than a quarter of their purchases were returned.",Group_by:"Group by",Sold_at_several_prices:"Sold at several prices in this period; this is the weighted average.",Restrict_Master_Data_By_Warehouse:"Restrict master data by warehouse",Restrict_Master_Data_By_Warehouse_Help:"When on, a user assigned to specific warehouses sees only the products, customers, suppliers, brands and categories connected to those warehouses. Records not yet used anywhere stay visible, so newly created ones are never hidden. Sales, purchases and returns are always restricted and are not affected by this switch.",Restrict_Products_By_Warehouse:"Restrict products by warehouse",Restrict_Products_By_Warehouse_Help:"Every product gets a home warehouse — the branch it was created for. When on, a user assigned to specific warehouses sees, sells and edits only the products whose home warehouse is theirs, plus products that hold real stock in one of their warehouses (transferred or purchased in). Users who may access all warehouses always see everything.",Virtual_Combo_Stock:"Virtual combo stock",Virtual_Combo_Stock_Help:"When on, a combo product has no stock of its own: its availability is the number of combos its component products can still fill, and selling a combo takes stock from the components. When off, combos are assembled into stock with an Adjustment first.",Virtual_Combo_Stock_Warning:"Best chosen before selling combos. After combos have been sold or returned, switching makes later edits, deletions and returns of those documents reverse their stock the wrong way.",Virtual_Combo_Stock_Confirm_On_Title:"Turn on virtual combo stock?",Virtual_Combo_Stock_Confirm_On_Body:"Combos will sell straight from their component products, and their own stock will no longer be used.",Virtual_Combo_Stock_Confirm_Off_Title:"Turn off virtual combo stock?",Virtual_Combo_Stock_Confirm_Off_Body:"Combos will go back to their own stock, which has to be assembled from the components with an Adjustment before they can be sold.",Home_Warehouse:"Home warehouse",Home_Warehouse_Hint:"The branch this product belongs to. Users restricted to other warehouses will not see it unless stock is transferred to them.",Home_Warehouse_Required:"Choose the warehouse this product belongs to.",Combo_products_required:"Add at least one product to the combo.",Customer_Performance_Help:"Show a performance score and rating on the customer page, built from payment reliability, how recently they bought and their return rate.",Product_Supplier:"Supplier on products",Product_Supplier_Help:"Adds a default supplier field to the product form, shows it as a column on the product list, and lets you filter products by supplier to build a reorder list.",Default_Supplier_Hint:"Who you normally reorder this product from. Filter the product list by supplier to see everything to order from them.",Account_Ledger:"Account Ledger",Closing_Balance:"Closing Balance",Reconciliation:"Reconciliation",Recon_Intro:"Compares each cash and bank account’s operational balance with the General Ledger balance of its linked ledger account. This page is read-only: it never changes either balance.",Recon_Auto_Off:"Automatic journals are switched off, so new transactions are not posted to the General Ledger and will show as missing journals. Turn them on in Settings → Feature Toggles.",Recon_Operational_Balance:"Operational balance",Recon_GL_Balance:"GL balance",Recon_Difference:"Difference",Recon_Unreconciled:"Unreconciled accounts",Recon_Reconciled:"Reconciled",Recon_Out_Of_Balance:"Out of balance",Recon_Not_Linked:"This account has no ledger postings yet.",Recon